  "what_the_study_did": "The study performed a comprehensive analysis of rodent models of diabetic kidney disease (DKD) to compare treatment efficacy from preclinical testing with outcomes from clinical trials and to investigate if rodent models are predictive for clinical outcomes of therapeutic agents in human DKD.",
